duty[spec](s_a_perspective_isolation, acceptance, "START.md", 117, "a rule reading a perspective it cannot see matches nothing").
duty[spec](s_a_stratum_order, acceptance, "START.md", 117, "negation executes in stratum order").
duty[spec](s_a_kernel_grep, acceptance, "START.md", 119, "no relation name outside").
duty[spec](s_a_runtime_rule, acceptance, "START.md", 119, "starts deriving without restart or reload").
duty[spec](s_a_malformed_sibling, acceptance, "START.md", 119, "is condemned by its sibling rule").
duty[spec](s_a_round_trip, acceptance, "START.md", 119, "round-trip test from").
duty[spec](s_a_counter, acceptance, "START.md", 121, "counter.rofl runs").
duty[spec](s_a_replay_shuffled, acceptance, "START.md", 121, "bit-identical states across 100 runs with shuffled insertion order").
duty[spec](s_a_busy_beaver, acceptance, "START.md", 121, "executes a 3-state busy beaver to halt under budget").
duty[spec](s_a_diverging_hole, acceptance, "START.md", 121, "a diverging variant yields").
duty[spec](s_a_boot_audits_empty, acceptance, "START.md", 121, "all four audit queries return empty").
duty[spec](s_a_sensors_scenario, acceptance, "START.md", 121, "full scenario passes").

-- §6, definition of done.
duty[spec](s_done_ci_green, done, "START.md", 127, "criteria green in CI").
duty[spec](s_done_readme, done, "START.md", 128, "a paragraph on every place where you deviated").
duty[spec](s_done_limits, done, "START.md", 129, "honestly listing what v0 does not do").

-- §7, the prohibited shortcuts. Each voids acceptance.
duty[spec](s7_no_hardcoded_boot, prohibited, "START.md", 133, "Hardcoding any boot.rofl rule").
