duty[limits](l_reuse_b_stratum_gate, limit, "LIMITS.md", 44, "SCHEDULE is an input to every derivation").
duty[limits](l_reuse_c_tick_boundary, limit, "LIMITS.md", 60, "Nothing").
duty[limits](l_reuse_switchable, limit, "LIMITS.md", 66, "Reuse can be switched off").
duty[limits](l_no_multi_fact_abduction, limit, "LIMITS.md", 72, "Every level of `whynot` is single-step").
duty[limits](l_whynot_recurses, limit, "LIMITS.md", 75, "It does now recurse *into* each failing premise").
duty[limits](l_no_occurs_check, limit, "LIMITS.md", 83, "No occurs-check").
duty[limits](l_no_persistence, limit, "LIMITS.md", 86, "No persistence beyond store serialization").
duty[limits](l_partial_strata, limit, "LIMITS.md", 89, "Stratum inference is data-driven and can be partial").
duty[limits](l_unchecked_without_boot, limit, "LIMITS.md", 101, "negation is").
duty[limits](l_demand_premise_order, limit, "LIMITS.md", 113, "Rules that are not range-restricted").
duty[limits](l_demand_depth_512, limit, "LIMITS.md", 115, "Recursion depth through demand rules is capped at").
duty[limits](l_demand_no_enumeration, limit, "LIMITS.md", 120, "with all arguments unbound cannot").
duty[limits](l_queries_are_god_view, limit, "LIMITS.md", 122, "Queries are god-view").
duty[limits](l_budget_counts_firings, limit, "LIMITS.md", 124, "Budgets count distinct firings + demand nodes").
duty[limits](l_no_floats_no_bignums, limit, "LIMITS.md", 127, "No floats, no bignums").
duty[limits](l_zero_divisor_fails, limit, "LIMITS.md", 128, "division/modulo by zero simply fails the builtin premise").
duty[limits](l_comparisons_need_ground_ints, limit, "LIMITS.md", 129, "builtins require ground integer operands").
duty[limits](l_reflection_in_main, limit, "LIMITS.md", 130, "Reflection facts live in").
duty[limits](l_asserted_by_needs_who, limit, "LIMITS.md", 133, "assert provides a").
duty[limits](l_retraction_leaves_no_trail, limit, "LIMITS.md", 136, "a retraction removes the trail rows outright").
duty[limits](l_init_after_zero_inert, limit, "LIMITS.md", 139, "after tick 0 is inert").
duty[limits](l_next_not_assertable, limit, "LIMITS.md", 140, "are not assertable directly").
duty[limits](l_frozen_never_collected, limit, "LIMITS.md", 141, "Frozen provenance is never garbage-collected").
duty[limits](l_undefined_is_a_dictionary, limit, "LIMITS.md", 144, "a dictionary check, not a coverage check").
duty[limits](l_undefined_silent_on_negation, limit, "LIMITS.md", 147, "nothing about negated").
duty[limits](l_undefined_silenced_by_one_fact, limit, "LIMITS.md", 151, "one stray fact of the right name silences the audit").
