duty[decided](d_next_in_body_rejected, guaranteed, "docs/time-and-continuity.md", 59, "is rejected by the parser, deliberately").
duty[decided](d_veto_belongs_inside, guaranteed, "docs/time-and-continuity.md", 114, "A veto the model can express belongs inside the model").
duty[decided](d_retain_ticks, guaranteed, "docs/time-and-continuity.md", 160, "keeps the current tick's provenance plus the").
duty[decided](d_retention_off_by_default, guaranteed, "docs/time-and-continuity.md", 164, "It is off unless asked for").
duty[decided](d_retention_conditional, guaranteed, "docs/time-and-continuity.md", 170, "Retention is conditional on whether the program reads its own provenance").
duty[decided](d_tick_records_budget, guaranteed, "docs/time-and-continuity.md", 186, "a tick now records the budget it was evaluated with").

