-- ========================================================== the map [map] ==
-- Editorial links: which check stands behind which duty, which sentence
-- replaced which. Every check below is named exactly as it is written in the
-- tree; `scanners/spec.ts` looks each one up, and a rename breaks the link
-- loudly (`dangling[coverage]`) instead of quietly.

-- ---- checks, as cited -----------------------------------------------------

cited_check[map](c_grep_test, "test/phase3.test.ts", "kernel grep test: no relation name outside the vocabulary in kernel source").
cited_check[map](c_grepcheck_gate, "scripts/kernel_grep.ts", "npm run grepcheck").
